/-
# L5Reg.Reg94 : the lines clause for every class of the local table of rep #94 (generated by l5reg)

Every local class `i < nT` of rep #94 (50 classes) is matched to the lines record `(chunk, index)` of `adv` with a 3x3 integer matrix `M` (UNTRUSTED advice): the kernel checks
`G l'_i = sum_k M_ik l_k` (G from digits 1..10 of the record), the signed-permutation property of G, and that every local range lies in a record range (`L5Reg.Equiv.eqChk`).
The theorem takes, for each chunk used, the lines clause of the chunk's records (from `Lin.lines_clause_tab` via `L5Reg.Mem`).
No `sorry`, no `native_decide`, no new axiom.  Not registered in any aggregator.
-/
import LRSpectrumFull.L5Reg.Equiv
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.GD3O94T
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC29
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC37
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC95
import LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.LinRQSC96

set_option maxRecDepth 1000000
set_option maxHeartbeats 0

namespace LRSpectrumFull
namespace L5Reg
namespace R94
open LRSpectrumFull.L5S3 LRSpectrumFull.L5S4 LRSpectrumFull.L5S4.Lin

def bls : List (ℕ × List (ℕ × ℕ)) := [(29, LinRQSC29.blobs), (37, LinRQSC37.blobs), (95, LinRQSC95.blobs), (96, LinRQSC96.blobs)]
def adv : List (ℕ × ℕ × List ℤ) := [(96, 18, [1, 0, 0, -1, -1, 0, 0, 1, -1]), (96, 19, [0, 0, 1, 0, -1, -1, -1, 1, 1]), (96, 20, [0, -1, 1, 0, 1, 0, -1, 0, 0]), (95, 145, [2, 0, -1, -1, 2, 0, 2, 1, -1]), (95, 146, [2, -1, 0, -1, 1, -2, 2, -1, 1]), (96, 21, [0, 0, 1, 0, -1, -1, -1, 1, 0]), (96, 22, [0, 1, -1, 2, -1, 0, -3, -1, 2]), (96, 23, [0, 1, -1, 2, -1, 0, -3, -1, 2]), (96, 24, [0, -1, 0, 2, 1, -1, 3, 0, -1]), (96, 25, [0, 0, 1, 0, 1, -1, -1, 1, 0]), (96, 26, [0, 0, 1, 0, 1, -1, -1, 0, 1]), (95, 137, [0, -1, 1, -1, 1, 0, 0, -1, 0]), (96, 27, [2, 0, -1, -2, 1, 1, -1, -1, 0]), (96, 28, [0, -1, 0, 2, 0, -1, 3, -2, -1]), (96, 29, [0, 0, 1, 0, 1, -1, -1, 0, 0]), (37, 176, [0, 0, 1, -1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 1]), (96, 30, [2, -1, -1, -2, 0, 1, -1, 1, 0]), (96, 31, [2, -1, -1, -2, 1, 0, -1, 0, -1]), (96, 32, [1, 0, 0, -1, -2, 1, 0, 3, -2]), (96, 33, [1, 0, 0, -1, 0, -1, 0, -1, 2]), (96, 34, [2, -1, -1, -2, 1, 2, -1, 0, 2]), (96, 35, [2, -1, -1, -2, 1, 0, 1, -1, 1]), (96, 36, [2, -1, -1, -2, 2, 1, -1, 2, 0]), (96, 37, [1, 0, 0, -1, -1, 1, -1, 0, 1]), (96, 38, [1, 0, 0, -1, -3, 2, -1, 1, -1]), (96, 39, [1, 0, 0, -1, 2, -1, 0, -3, 2]), (96, 40, [1, 0, 0, -1, 0, -1, 0, -1, 2]), (96, 41, [0, 1, 0, -3, -1, 1, 4, 0, -1]), (96, 42, [2, 0, -1, -2, -3, 2, -1, 1, 0]), (96, 43, [2, -1, -1, -2, 2, 1, -1, 0, 1]), (96, 44, [2, 0, -1, -2, -3, 2, -1, 4, -1]), (95, 140, [0, -2, 1, -4, 1, 2, -3, -2, 3]), (96, 45, [1, 0, 0, -1, 1, 0, -1, 1, -1]), (96, 46, [1, 1, -1, -1, 2, 0, -1, 4, -1]), (96, 47, [0, 1, 0, -3, -1, 2, 2, -1, -1]), (96, 48, [1, 1, -1, -1, 2, -1, -1, 4, -2]), (96, 49, [2, 0, -1, -2, -3, 3, -1, 1, 0]), (96, 50, [2, 0, -1, -2, -3, 3, -1, 4, -2]), (96, 51, [2, 0, -1, -2, -3, 2, -1, 4, -1]), (96, 52, [2, -1, 0, -2, 2, -1, -1, 2, -1]), (96, 53, [1, 0, 0, -1, -1, 1, -1, 1, 0]), (96, 54, [1, 0, 0, -1, 3, -2, -1, -1, 1]), (96, 55, [1, 0, 0, -1, 3, -2, 0, -4, 3]), (37, 162, [1, 0, 0, 0, -4, 1, 1, -3, 1]), (96, 56, [1, 1, -1, -1, 2, -1, -1, 4, -2]), (37, 145, [1, 1, -1, 0, 2, -1, -1, 2, 0]), (